                        <additions><p><locus from="1b">Folio 1b</locus>: The text in Persian and
                                then in Arabic seems to be of an alchemical character, as though the
                                writer had confounded the present work with another which
                                is of that kind.</p>
                            <p>Numerous marginal glosses throughout, and corrections in the text;
                                some of which seem to be in the handwriting of the
                            copyist..</p></additions>
